<Legal title="Privacy information" description="How Kanban Pro uses account and workspace information for team collaboration.">
  <p>Kanban Pro uses ProAppStore sign-in. Workspace memberships, boards, cards, assignments and comments support collaboration between workspace members.</p>
  <h2>Shared workspaces</h2>
  <p>Board content is shared through the app’s workspace and membership features. Real-time rooms support presence and board updates. Keep workspace invitations and private card details within the people you intend to share them with.</p>
  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>The contact form sends the name, email and message you enter to the platform’s enquiry service.</p>
  <h2>Platform policy</h2>
  <p>Read the existing <a href="https://proappstore.online/privacy">ProAppStore Privacy Policy</a> for platform account, hosting and data-handling information. For questions, use the contact form on the <a href="/">Kanban Pro home page</a>.</p>
</Legal>
